Package: grandpa
Type: Package
Title: GeneRAtive Networks using Property and Degree Augmentation
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Carly", "Bobak", email = "Carly.Anne.Bobak@dartmouth.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Yifan", "Zhao", email = "Yifan.Zhao.GR@dartmouth.edu",
           role = "aut"))
Description: GRANDPA generates synthetic networks from an observed graph using both the observed vertex-attribute structure and topological augmentation based on degree and community membership. It preserves attribute frequencies and degree characteristics of the source network while producing graphs of a user-specified size.
